  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Election support Tunisia, 2011-2014 - UNDP Election support Tunisia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP Valst&#xf6;d i Tunisien, 2011-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta UNDP-projekt syftar till att st&#xf6;da den tunisiska valmyndigheten inf&#xf6;r kommande val i landet. Aktiviteterna inbegriper &#xe4;ven st&#xf6;d till  valdeltagande i stort samt till kvinnliga kandidater.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This UNDP project aims to assist the Tunisian election administration with regards to the upcoming elections in the country. Activities are also designed to promote election participation and to strengthen     female political candidates.</narrative>
  </description>
